{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">觀塘翠屏北邨有單位起火冒煙，一名女子手部燒傷，送院治理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">清晨五時許警方接獲多人報案，指翠梓樓低層有單位冒出濃煙。消防到場將火救熄，單位內有一名女子手部燒傷，清醒送院。消防初步相信是電線短路引致火警，十多人自行疏散到安全地方。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.KT-0630.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026uxpBflA6aR1784589540.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.KT-0630.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-20T23:38:23.518913+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}